<%# First visit: the fund has no statement setup yet. Two ways in (journey step A3). %>
<div class="card shadow-sm mb-4" id="fs_setup">
  <div class="card-body p-4">
    <h4 class="mb-2">Produce this fund's Balance Sheet and P&amp;L from its account entries</h4>
    <p class="text-muted mb-4">
      CapHive needs to know which account entries make up each statement line. You do this once; after that,
      generate statements for any period in one click. Every set is checked to balance and to tie to the NAV
      before it can be locked.
    </p>
    <div class="row g-3">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100">
          <h6><i class="ti ti-robot-face text-info"></i> Start from last year's statements</h6>
          <p class="small text-muted mb-3">Upload the fund's latest financial statements (PDF or Excel). The AI proposes the
            accounts, layout and mapping, and CapHive checks every line against the printed figures. Nothing is saved until you approve.</p>
          <% if policy(FinancialStatementMappingSuggestion.new(fund:, entity_id: fund.entity_id)).create? %>
            <%= link_to "Suggest from statements", new_financial_statement_mapping_suggestion_path(fund_id: fund.id), class: "btn btn-outline-info", id: "fs_setup_ai" %>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100">
          <h6><i class="ti ti-pencil text-primary"></i> Set up by hand</h6>
          <p class="small text-muted mb-3">Creates the Balance Sheet, Profit &amp; Loss and Statement of Changes in Partners' Capital with
            standard sections. You then add accounts and map the fund's entries to them.</p>
          <% if policy(FinancialStatement.new(fund:, entity_id: fund.entity_id)).setup? %>
            <%= button_to "Set up by hand", setup_financial_statements_path(fund_id: fund.id), class: "btn btn-outline-primary", id: "fs_setup_manual" %>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <% unless policy(FinancialStatement.new(fund:, entity_id: fund.entity_id)).setup? %>
      <p class="text-muted mt-3 mb-0">Ask a user with edit access to this fund to set up its financial statements.</p>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
